D = (54.91508102416992, -144.1999969482422, 0.00000019073486612342094)
Worker quad: A-B-D plus A-C-D (diagonal A-D).
Mayor quad: B-C-D plus A-B-C (diagonal B-C).
Every unmatched vertex has an exact counterpart in the other mesh (delta 0).
